# src/apps/daemon/internal/platform/service

## Purpose
Owns operating-system service integration for installing, controlling, or querying the LumiNet daemon service.

## Contents
Contains Go service-management abstractions and platform-specific adapters where service managers differ.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Called by daemon/CLI platform flows and depends on OS service-manager APIs, process identity, permissions, and filesystem configuration.

## Invariants
Service mutations are idempotent where possible, privilege errors are surfaced, platform-specific behavior remains isolated, and failed operations do not report a state transition that did not occur.